✅ Tense – Important Questions for SSC CGL

📘 Basic MCQs (With Explanation)

1. He ___ to school every day.
a) go
b) goes
c) gone
d) going
✅ उत्तर: b) goes (Simple Present – he के साथ "goes")


2. I ___ my homework now.
a) do
b) did
c) am doing
d) have done
✅ उत्तर: c) am doing (Present Continuous – "now" शब्द संकेत करता है)


3. She ___ a song when I entered.
a) sang
b) sings
c) was singing
d) is singing
✅ उत्तर: c) was singing (Past Continuous – दूसरे कार्य के बीच)


4. They ___ in Delhi since 2010.
a) live
b) lived
c) are living
d) have been living
✅ उत्तर: d) have been living (Present Perfect Continuous – since)


5. I ___ a letter yesterday.
a) write
b) wrote
c) written
d) was writing
✅ उत्तर: b) wrote (Simple Past – yesterday)


6. By next year, he ___ his studies.
a) completes
b) will complete
c) will have completed
d) had completed
✅ उत्तर: c) will have completed (Future Perfect)


7. Ravi ___ here for 2 hours.
a) has been waiting
b) is waiting
c) was waiting
d) will wait
✅ उत्तर: a) has been waiting (Present Perfect Continuous – for)


8. She ___ a book when the light went off.
a) reads
b) read
c) is reading
d) was reading
✅ उत्तर: d) was reading (Past Continuous)


9. I ___ my dinner already.
a) eat
b) ate
c) have eaten
d) eating
✅ उत्तर: c) have eaten (Present Perfect – already)


10. When I reached the station, the train ___.
a) left
b) had left
c) leaves
d) will leave
✅ उत्तर: b) had left (Past Perfect – दो क्रियाओं में पहले)




---

🔟 One-Liner MCQs

11. He will ___ the train. → ✅ catch


12. She ___ English very well. → ✅ speaks


13. I ___ to him for an hour. → ✅ have been talking


14. We ___ TV when he came. → ✅ were watching


15. The boys ___ the game yesterday. → ✅ played


16. I ___ the letter before he arrived. → ✅ had written


17. They ___ this work by tomorrow. → ✅ will have done


18. Ritu ___ dinner now. → ✅ is making


19. I ___ this movie twice. → ✅ have seen


20. She ___ home before sunset. → ✅ will reach




