🎯 Bonus Practice (Fill in the blanks)

21. I ___ (study) for the test since morning. → ✅ have been studying


22. He usually ___ (go) to the gym in the morning. → ✅ goes


23. They ___ (play) cricket when it started to rain. → ✅ were playing


24. She ___ (complete) her homework just now. → ✅ has completed


25. By evening, we ___ (finish) our project. → ✅ will have finished




